    },
    {
      "text": "Combine chocolate chips, almond butter, and maple syrup in a microwave-safe dish. Microwave in 30-second intervals, stirring after each interval, until chocolate has melted. Add chopped cashews and spread mixture onto the prepared baking dish.",
